// https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Barq%27s_wordmark.svg, rotated 10.1 degrees and
// wrapped onto the cylinder so that it overlays the script on the Kroger packshot
// (parameters fitted numerically against the photo). Coordinates are packshot pixels
// relative to (691, 449); the can is 383 px wide there.
